# Authors: Simon Davidson & Claude | Created 2026-08-20 | Last modified 2026-08-20
#
# tb_hu_compute with FMAX_PIPE=1 AND pseudo-random pak_full_i back-pressure.
#
# Back-pressure was never driven by either Hadamard testbench, yet pak_full_i is
# the one input that can corrupt data if the producer ignores it: the packer
# latches pak_index_latched/last on ANY pak_write_i regardless of buffer_full
# (shared/packer.v:121-126). This is the standing guard for that contract.
xrun -sv -timescale 1ns/1ps -access wrc -top tb_hu_compute \
  -define HU_FMAX_PIPE -define HU_BP \
  hu_compute.v tb_hu_compute.v
